  "prompt": "You are an expert frontend developer and UI designer. Create a single-page, standalone HTML document containing a complex, animated \"System Monitor\" dashboard with a heavy Cyberpunk / Sci-Fi aesthetic.\n\nSTRICT TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS:\n1. ALL HTML, CSS, and JavaScript must be contained within a single file. Do not import external libraries (no React, no Tailwind, no external CSS). You may use Google Fonts (e.g., 'Share Tech Mono' or 'Orbitron').\n2. Do NOT output markdown code blocks (```html). Start exactly with <!DOCTYPE html> and end with </html>.\n\nLAYOUT SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The layout must feature a permanent, fixed sidebar on the left side (approx 250px wide) containing a futuristic user profile and at least four functional-looking navigation buttons.\n2. The main content area must utilize a responsive CSS Grid structure to display at least three distinct data panels.\n\nAESTHETIC & GEOMETRIC SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The color palette must be dark mode: deep black backgrounds (#050505), with neon cyan, hot magenta, and toxic green accents.\n2. To achieve a seamless Sci-Fi look, the primary data panels must feature an inward-curving top corner (a custom border-radius or clip-path cut-out), giving it a highly structured, non-boxy appearance.\n3. Include a subtle, semi-transparent CSS \"scanline\" overlay across the entire viewport to simulate a CRT monitor.\n\nANIMATION & INTERACTIVITY SPECIFICATIONS (JavaScript required):\n1. Glitch Effect: The main dashboard header text must feature a CSS keyframe animation that occasionally \"glitches\" (splitting colors or offsetting text for a split second).\n2. Live Telemetry: One of the grid panels must contain a \"CPU/RAM Load\" bar chart or circular progress indicator. Use JavaScript to randomly update these values and animate the bars/circles every 800 milliseconds.\n3. Terminal Output: Another panel must act as a terminal window. Use JavaScript to automatically append simulated, matrix-style data logs (e.g., \"0x00FF... BYPASSING SECURITY...\") that scroll continuously.\n\nEnsure the final output is visually stunning, responsive, and immediately interactive upon loading.\n",
  "rawOutput": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NEURAL_LINK // SYSTEM_MONITOR</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #050505;\n            --panel-bg: rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.85);\n            --cyan: #00f3ff;\n            --magenta: #ff00ff;\n            --green: #39ff14;\n            --border-glow: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.3);\n            --sidebar-width: 250px;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            cursor: crosshair;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--cyan);\n            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            height: 100vh;\n            width: 100vw;\n        }\n\n        /* CRT Scanline Overlay */\n        body::before {\n            content: \" \";\n            display: block;\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 50%), \n                        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.03), rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.01), rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.03));\n            z-index: 9999;\n            background-size: 100% 3px, 3px 100%;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Sidebar */\n        aside {\n            position: fixed;\n            left: 0;\n            top: 0;\n            width: var(--sidebar-width);\n            height: 100vh;\n            background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.95);\n            border-right: 1px solid var(--cyan);\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding: 20px;\n            z-index: 100;\n            box-shadow: 5px 0 15px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .profile-section {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding-bottom: 30px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .avatar {\n            width: 80px;\n            height: 80px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            border: 2px solid var(--magenta);\n            background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #111, #111 5px, #222 5px, #222 10px);\n            position: relative;\n            clip-path: polygon(20% 0%, 80% 0%, 100% 20%, 100% 80%, 80% 100%, 20% 100%, 0% 80%, 0% 20%);\n        }\n\n        .avatar::after {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--cyan) 0%, transparent 70%);\n            opacity: 0.3;\n        }\n\n        .user-name {\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            color: var(--magenta);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn {\n            background: transparent;\n            border: 1px solid var(--cyan);\n            color: var(--cyan);\n            padding: 12px;\n            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n            text-align: left;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn:hover {\n            background: var(--cyan);\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--cyan);\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn::before {\n            content: \"> \";\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn:hover::before {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        /* Main Content Area */\n        main {\n            margin-left: var(--sidebar-width);\n            padding: 30px;\n            height: 100vh;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            grid-template-rows: auto 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 25px;\n        }\n\n        /* Header Glitch Effect */\n        .dashboard-header {\n            grid-column: span 3;\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            position: relative;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .glitch {\n            position: relative;\n            color: var(--cyan);\n            animation: glitch-skew 1s infinite linear alternate-reverse;\n        }\n\n        .glitch::before, .glitch::after {\n            content: attr(data-text);\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .glitch::before {\n            left: 2px;\n            text-shadow: -2px 0 var(--magenta);\n            clip: rect(44px, 450px, 56px, 0);\n            animation: glitch-anim 5s infinite linear alternate-reverse;\n        }\n\n        .glitch::after {\n            left: -2px;\n            text-shadow: -2px 0 var(--green);\n            clip: rect(44px, 450px, 56px, 0);\n            animation: glitch-anim2 5s infinite linear alternate-reverse;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes glitch-anim {\n            0% { clip: rect(31px, 9999px, 94px, 0); }\n            20% { clip: rect(62px, 9999px, 42px, 0); }\n            40% { clip: rect(10px, 9999px, 88px, 0); }\n            60% { clip: rect(55px, 9999px, 23px, 0); }\n            80% { clip: rect(80px, 9999px, 67px, 0); }\n            100% { clip: rect(20px, 9999px, 12px, 0); }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes glitch-anim2 {\n            0% { clip: rect(70px, 9999px, 10px, 0); }\n            20% { clip: rect(15px, 9999px, 50px, 0); }\n            40% { clip: rect(90px, 9999px, 30px, 0); }\n            60% { clip: rect(40px, 9999px, 90px, 0); }\n            80% { clip: rect(10px, 9999px, 10px, 0); }\n            100% { clip: rect(50px, 9999px, 80px, 0); }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes glitch-skew {\n            0% { transform: skew(0deg); }\n            10% { transform: skew(3deg); }\n            20% { transform: skew(-2deg); }\n            30% { transform: skew(0deg); }\n            100% { transform: skew(0deg); }\n        }\n\n        /* Panel Styling */\n        .panel {\n            background: var(--panel-bg);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 20px;\n            /* The \"Inward-Curving\" Top Corner Effect */\n            clip-path: polygon(0% 15px, 15px 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);\n        }\n\n        .panel::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.05) 0%, transparent 100%);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .panel-title {\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: var(--magenta);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.2);\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        /* Telemetry Panel */\n        .telemetry-container {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .stat-row {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .stat-label {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .progress-bar-bg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 10px;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .progress-bar-fill {\n            height: 100%;\n            width: 0%;\n            background: var(--cyan);\n            transition: width 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--cyan);\n        }\n\n        .progress-bar-fill.ram { background: var(--magenta); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--magenta); }\n        .progress-bar-fill.cpu { background: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--green); }\n\n        /* Terminal Panel */\n        .terminal-panel {\n            grid-row: span 2;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n\n        #terminal-output {\n            flex-grow: 1;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: var(--green);\n            overflow-y: hidden;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: flex-end;\n        }\n\n        .log-entry {\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n\n        .log-entry.system { color: var(--cyan); }\n        .log-entry.error { color: var(--magenta); }\n        .log-entry.warn { color: #ffcc00; }\n\n        /* Network/Grid Panel */\n        .network-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(10, 1fr);\n            gap: 4px;\n            height: 120px;\n            align-items: end;\n        }\n\n        .net-bar {\n            background: var(--cyan);\n            width: 100%;\n            transition: height 0.4s ease;\n        }\n\n        /* Security Status Panel */\n        .status-large {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            height: 100%;\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            color: var(--green);\n            text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--green);\n        }\n\n        /* Responsive Adjustments */\n        @media (max-width: 1000px) {\n            main {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n            .dashboard-header { grid-column: span 2; }\n            .terminal-panel { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: auto; }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 700px) {\n            aside { width: 70px; padding: 10px; }\n            .user-name, .nav-btn span { display: none; }\n            main { margin-left: 70px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .dashboard-header { grid-column: span 1; font-size: 1.5rem; }\n            .terminal-panel { grid-column: span 1; }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <aside>\n        <div class=\"profile-section\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\"></div>\n            <div class=\"user-name\">OPERATOR_01</div>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"nav-menu\">\n            <button class=\"nav-btn\"><span>DASHBOARD</span></button>\n            <button class=\"nav-btn\"><span>NETWORK</span></button>\n            <button class=\"nav-btn\"><span>SECURITY</span></button>\n            <button class=\"nav-btn\"><span>SYSTEM</span></button>\n            <button class=\"nav-btn\"><span>LOGOUT</span></button>\n        </nav>\n    </aside>\n\n    <main>\n        <header class=\"dashboard-header\">\n            <h1 class=\"glitch\" data-text=\"SYSTEM_MONITOR_V4.0\">SYSTEM_MONITOR_V4.0</h1>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Telemetry Panel -->\n        <section class=\"panel\">\n            <div class=\"panel-title\">\n                <span>CORE_TELEMETRY</span>\n                <span style=\"color: var(--cyan);\">LIVE</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"telemetry-container\">\n                <div class=\"stat-row\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">\n                        <span>CPU_LOAD</span>\n                        <span id=\"cpu-val\">0%</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar-bg\">\n                        <div id=\"cpu-bar\" class=\"progress-bar-fill cpu\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-row\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">\n                        <span>RAM_USAGE</span>\n                        <span id=\"ram-val\">0%</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar-bg\">\n                        <div id=\"ram-bar\" class=\"progress-bar-fill ram\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-row\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">\n                        <span>TEMP_CORE</span>\n                        <span id=\"temp-val\">42\u00b0C</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar-bg\">\n                        <div id=\"temp-bar\" class=\"progress-bar-fill\" style=\"background: var(--magenta); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--magenta);\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Terminal Panel -->\n        <section class=\"panel terminal-panel\">\n            <div class=\"panel-title\">\n                <span>SYSTEM_LOGS</span>\n                <span id=\"log-status\" style=\"color: var(--green);\">CONNECTED</span>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"terminal-output\">\n                <!-- Logs injected by JS -->\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Network Panel -->\n        <section class=\"panel\">\n            <div class=\"panel-title\">\n                <span>NET_TRAFFIC</span>\n                <span>KB/S</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"network-grid\" id=\"net-grid\">\n                <!-- Bars injected by JS -->\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Security Panel -->\n        <section class=\"panel\">\n            <div class=\"panel-title\">\n                <span>SECURITY_STATUS</span>\n                <span>ENCRYPTED</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"status-large\" id=\"security-status\">\n                STABLE\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // 1. Terminal Logic\n        const terminal = document.getElementById('terminal-output');\n        const logEntries = [\n            { text: \"INITIALIZING NEURAL LINK...\", type: \"system\" },\n            { text: \"BYPASSING FIREWALL [0x00FF]...\", type: \"system\" },\n            { text: \"ACCESS GRANTED: USER_01\", type: \"system\" },\n            { text: \"WARNING: UNKNOWN PACKET DETECTED\", type: \"warn\" },\n            { text: \"ENCRYPTING DATA STREAM...\", type: \"system\" },\n            { text: \"CRITICAL: MEMORY LEAK IN SECTOR 7\", type: \"error\" },\n            { text: \"RE-ROUTING THROUGH PROXY...\", type: \"system\" },\n            { text: \"CONNECTION STABLE\", type: \"system\" },\n            { text: \"SCANNING SUBNET 192.168.1.0/24\", type: \"system\" },\n            { text: \"INTRUSION ATTEMPT BLOCKED\", type: \"error\" },\n            { text: \"SYNCING WITH CORE...\", type: \"system\" },\n            { text: \"DATA PACKET RECEIVED: 204kb\", type: \"system\" }\n        ];\n\n        function addLog() {\n            const entry = logEntries[Math.floor(Math.random() * logEntries.length)];\n            const div = document.createElement('div');\n            div.className = `log-entry ${entry.type}`;\n            const timestamp = new Date().toLocaleTimeString('en-GB', { hour12: false, hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', second: '2-digit' });\n            div.textContent = `[${timestamp}] ${entry.text}`;\n            terminal.appendChild(div);\n\n            if (terminal.childNodes.length > 20) {\n                terminal.removeChild(terminal.firstChild);\n            }\n        }\n\n        setInterval(addLog, 1200);\n\n        // 2. Telemetry Logic\n        const cpuBar = document.getElementById('cpu-bar');\n        const cpuVal = document.getElementById('cpu-val');\n        const ramBar = document.getElementById('ram-bar');\n        const ramVal = document.getElementById('ram-val');\n        const tempBar = document.getElementById('temp-bar');\n        const tempVal = document.getElementById('temp-val');\n        const securityStatus = document.getElementById('security-status');\n\n        function updateTelemetry() {\n            const cpu = Math.floor(Math.random() * 100);\n            const ram = Math.floor(Math.random() * 100);\n            const temp = Math.floor(Math.random() * 40) + 30;\n\n            cpuBar.style.width = `${cpu}%`;\n            cpuVal.textContent = `${cpu}%`;\n\n            ramBar.style.width = `${ram}%`;\n            ramVal.textContent = `${ram}%`;\n\n            tempBar.style.width = `${(temp / 100) * 100}%`;\n            tempVal.textContent = `${temp}\u00b0C`;\n\n            // Update security status based on CPU load\n            if (cpu > 90) {\n                securityStatus.textContent = \"CRITICAL\";\n                securityStatus.style.color = \"var(--magenta)\";\n                securityStatus.style.textShadow = \"0 0 15px var(--magenta)\";\n            } else if (cpu > 70) {\n                securityStatus.textContent = \"UNSTABLE\";\n                securityStatus.style.color = \"#ffcc00\";\n                securityStatus.style.textShadow = \"0 0 15px #ffcc00\";\n            } else {\n                securityStatus.textContent = \"STABLE\";\n                securityStatus.style.color = \"var(--green)\";\n                securityStatus.style.textShadow = \"0 0 15px var(--green)\";\n            }\n        }\n\n        setInterval(updateTelemetry, 800);\n\n        // 3. Network Grid Logic\n        const netGrid = document.getElementById('net-grid');\n        const barCount = 20;\n        const bars = [];\n\n        for (let i = 0; i < barCount; i++) {\n            const bar = document.createElement('div');\n            bar.className = 'net-bar';\n            bar.style.height = '10%';\n            netGrid.appendChild(bar);\n            bars.push(bar);\n        }\n\n        function updateNetwork() {\n            bars.forEach(bar => {\n                const height = Math.floor(Math.random() * 100);\n                bar.style.height = `${height}%`;\n                // Change color based on intensity\n                if (height > 80) {\n                    bar.style.background = 'var(--magenta)';\n                } else {\n                    bar.style.background = 'var(--cyan)';\n                }\n            });\n        }\n\n        setInterval(updateNetwork, 400);\n\n        // Initial calls\n        updateTelemetry();\n        updateNetwork();\n        addLog();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
